Package: nitro
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: greetd
Description: minimal, snappy desktop stack for Linux
 A KMS compositor with a retained scene graph, a small retained-mode
 toolkit, and a handful of shell apps: session, bar, launcher,
 wallpaper, terminal, file manager, settings, calculator, audio and
 video players, and a greeter with lock screen.
 .
 Start it from tty1 with `exec nitro-session`, or from greetd.
